+    // invoking N_PVoice.dc_dma. Every voice is initialized with __amDMA, but a
+    // voice racing a pool transition can survive just long enough for dc_dma
+    // and dc_dmaState to be overwritten by newly-loaded sample bytes. Recover
+    // only that exact indirect-call site: restore the real callback/state for
+    // the current call, without mutating the stale descriptor or skipping the
+    // game's decoder/DMA path.
